  m_Name: SO_NPC_Eldric_Profile
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCProfile
  npcId: eldric
  npcName: Eldric
  role: Village elder
  personality: Calm, cautious, responsible, protective of the village.
  backstory: Eldric has led the village for many years. He knows its people, traditions,
    conflicts, and important decisions.
  speakingStyle: Short, serious, grounded, slightly cautious.
  knowledgeTags:
  - village
  - order
  - leadership
  - bell
  - people
  - tradition
  knownFacts:
  - The old church bell was used to gather villagers and warn them of danger.
  - The missing bell can damage trust and create fear.
  - Mira often hears rumors before anyone else.
  - Borin can inspect metal traces and tools.
  - Anselm understands the symbolic meaning of the bell.
  relationships:
  - Trusts Borin with practical inspections.
  - Believes Mira knows the social mood of the village.
  - Respects Anselm as a keeper of traditions.
